{
  "title": "Technical Performance Dashboard",
  "tags": [
    "capacity",
    "technical",
    "performance"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 3,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "LoadId",
        "label": "Lote",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "postgres",
          "uid": "CapacityPostgreSQL"
        },
        "query": "select LoadId from TestLoad where Status = 'Succeeded' order by CreatedAt desc",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": false,
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "HostName",
        "label": "Equipo",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "postgres",
          "uid": "CapacityPostgreSQL"
        },
        "query": "select distinct Name as HostName from MonitoredResource union select distinct ComponentName as HostName from EnterpriseTechnologyComponent order by HostName",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": false,
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "ServiceId",
        "label": "Servicio/Subsistema",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "postgres",
          "uid": "CapacityPostgreSQL"
        },
        "query": "select distinct ServiceId from ServiceResourceMap union select distinct BusinessServiceId as ServiceId from EnterpriseTechnologyComponent where BusinessServiceId is not null order by ServiceId",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": false,
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "title": "Como leer este dashboard",
      "description": "Guia visible para interpretar los cuadros tecnicos de performance.",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Que muestra\nEste tablero separa performance tecnica por CPU, RAM, storage, IOPS, red, latencia, throughput, errores y saturacion.\n\n### Como interpretarlo\nPicos altos y P95 alto indican consumo sostenido; errores y latencia altos indican degradacion de servicio; saturacion alta indica riesgo operativo. Si no hay datos, falta carga o rango para esa metrica.\n\n### Accion sugerida\nEmpezar por Top Consumers And Outliers, confirmar la metrica afectada y revisar Threshold Breaches para priorizar remediacion."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "CPU Utilization",
      "description": "CPU performance by resource and load identifier. Missing data means no CPU samples are available for the selected range. Incluye linea actual, average del rango seleccionado y tendencia lineal segun el rango seleccionado.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "VictoriaMetrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "synthetic_cpu{load_id=~\"${LoadId:regex}\",host_name=~\"${HostName:regex}\",business_service_id=~\"${ServiceId:regex}\"}",
          "legendFormat": "CPU actual {{host_name}} {{load_id}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "avg_over_time(synthetic_cpu{load_id=~\"${LoadId:regex}\",host_name=~\"${HostName:regex}\",business_service_id=~\"${ServiceId:regex}\"}[$__range])",
          "legendFormat": "CPU average rango {{host_name}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "predict_linear(synthetic_cpu{load_id=~\"${LoadId:regex}\",host_name=~\"${HostName:regex}\",business_service_id=~\"${ServiceId:regex}\"}[$__range], 0)",
          "legendFormat": "CPU tendencia rango {{host_name}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "Ver graficos del equipo",
              "url": "/d/technical-performance/technical-performance-dashboard?var-LoadId=${LoadId}&var-HostName=${__data.fields.HostName}${__field.labels.host_name}&var-ServiceId=${__data.fields.ServiceId}${__data.fields.BusinessServiceId}",
              "targetBlank": false
            },
            {
              "title": "Ver subsistema o servicio",
              "url": "/d/technical-performance/technical-performance-dashboard?var-LoadId=${LoadId}&var-ServiceId=${__data.fields.ServiceId}${__data.fields.BusinessServiceId}&var-HostName=.*",
              "targetBlank": false
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
